#. speaker: ULALA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/022/FesPdy203_02223:TEXT_FESPDY203_02223_ULALA_000_023:1"
msgid "You mean to say that I'm the leader!? Am I surprised? O<hyphen>Of course, not! After all it is my destiny to become Eorzea's number one songstress!"
msgstr "Неужели я стала лидером!? Я удивлена? К-конечно, нет! Ведь мне суждено стать певицей номер один во всей Эорзее!"

